                            <comment id="16627342" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Tue, 25 Sep 2018 13:13:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The option &lt;tt&gt;--add-opens java.base/jdk.internal.loader=ALL-UNNAMED&lt;/tt&gt; must be added.&lt;/p&gt;

